# Ebb — State of Record

The ideal state this fleet is iterating toward, what has been established, and what was decided along the way. Written at install from the principal's answer; maintained by the commander.

## Goal

A public tide-table API that answers correctly for any UK coastal station, and a daily ingest that keeps it current without human attention.

## Claims

Established facts, each with the evidence that established it. A claim without evidence is a hope.

<!--
Empty at install, and deliberately so. An ISA with fabricated claims is worse
than an empty one, because the next reader treats it as authoritative.
-->

## Anti-claims

What this fleet is explicitly NOT doing, so nobody re-proposes it every month.

- Not building a UI. The API is the product.

